      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Introduction of small unsaturated alkylamino groups at the 4-position of the A-ring of the tricyclic framework (triazafluorenone) afforded extremely potent and selective mGluR1 antagonists with desirable properties. Compounds 11q and 11s are active in the SNL pain model with ED(50)s 3.3 and 6.4 mg/kg respectively. Metabolic outcome of propargyl amino moiety was studied."},
